#Taxonomy therefore NOT embedded in the .dmnd file despite command completing without error
#Workaround: taxonomy attached post-search via custom join script (taxify_diamond_results.sh

#FIX: Taxify all DIAMOND results using join (much faster than awk arrays for 149.8M row lookup table)

#join requires both files sorted on the join column first
